    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Parameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>Parameter</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>MethodParameter</code></a> and domain <a href=\"../../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.core\"><code>MethodParameter</code></a>和领域<a href=\"../../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>创建一个新的<a href=\"Parameter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.query 中的类\"><code>Parameter</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the required name of the parameter (through <a href=\"Param.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>Param</code></a> annotation or method parameter naming) or throws\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a> if the parameter has no name.",
      "translation": "返回参数的必需名称（通过 <a href=\"Param.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.query 中的注解接口\"><code>Param</code></a> 注解或方法参数命名），或者如果参数没有名称，则抛出\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the position index the parameter is bound to in the context of its surrounding <a href=\"Parameters.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>Parameters</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回该参数在其周围的<a href=\"Parameters.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>Parameters</code></a>上下文中绑定的位置索引。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the name of the parameter (through <a href=\"Param.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>Param</code></a> annotation or method parameter naming).",
      "translation": "返回参数名称（通过 `<a href=\"Param.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.query 中的注解接口\"><code>Param</code></a>` 注解或方法参数命名）。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the type of the <a href=\"Parameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>Parameter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回<a href=\"Parameter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.query 中的类\"><code>Parameter</code></a>的类型。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the <a href=\"Parameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>Parameter</code></a> is to be bound to a query.",
      "translation": "返回是否应将<a href=\"Parameter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.query 中的类\"><code>Parameter</code></a>绑定到查询。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the current <a href=\"Parameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>Parameter</code></a> is the one used for dynamic projections.",
      "translation": "返回当前<a href=\"Parameter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.query 中的类\"><code>Parameter</code></a>是否用于动态投影。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the parameter is named explicitly, i.e. annotated with <a href=\"Param.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>Param</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回该参数是否显式命名，即是否标注了<a href=\"Param.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.query 中的注解接口\"><code>Param</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the parameter is annotated with <a href=\"Param.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>Param</code></a> or has a method parameter name.",
      "translation": "判断该参数是否带有<a href=\"Param.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.query 中的注解接口\"><code>Param</code></a>注解，或者是否具有方法参数名称。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether the parameter is a special parameter.",
      "translation": "判断参数是否为特殊参数。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
