    {
      "source": "Class to abstract a single parameter of a query method. It is held in the context of a <a href=\"Parameters.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>Parameters</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "用于抽象查询方法单个参数的类。它被保存在<a href=\"Parameters.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.query 中的类\"><code>Parameters</code></a>实例的上下文中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the placeholder to be used for the parameter.",
      "translation": "返回用于该参数的占位符。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the placeholder to be used for the parameter. Can either be a named one or positional.",
      "translation": "返回用于参数的占位符。可以是命名占位符或位置占位符。",
      "count": 2
    },
