    {
      "source": "<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>the required parameter name.</dd>\n<dt>Throws:</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - if the parameter has no name.</dd>\n<dt>Since:</dt>\n<dd>3.4</dd>\n<dt>See Also:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list\">\n<li><a href=\"Param.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.repository.query\"><code>Param</code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/ParameterNameDiscoverer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>ParameterNameDiscoverer</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>所需的参数名称。</dd>\n<dt>抛出：</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - 如果参数没有名称。</dd>\n<dt>版本：</dt>\n<dd>3.4</dd>\n<dt>另请参见：</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list\">\n<li><a href=\"Param.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.query 中的注解接口\"><code>Param</code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/ParameterNameDiscoverer.html\" title=\"org.springframework.core 中的类或接口\"><code>ParameterNameDiscoverer</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "count": 1
